      "partTitle": "The Modern TLS 1.3 Handshake: 1-RTT Setup, Deprecated Ciphers & Forward Secrecy",
      "codeHash": "172f6e7a4f79612799c41b550a1ef9687c2992a075d2a954ae1aa9a91968629c",
      "spec": {
        "template": "table",
        "title": "Transport Layer Security protocol evolution TLS 1.2 versus TLS 1.3",
        "columns": [
